    "rationale": "Full layout loads five persistent predictors. Their upstream worker limits total about 6.0 GiB before Python, OpenCV, image, and output overhead. Non-full mode still loads four predictors totaling about 4.2 GiB and changes the region-class semantics under evaluation."
